#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Advanced scheduling and calendar system for School Management plugin. Manage"
" course schedules, events, and timetables."
msgstr ""
"Système avancé de planification et de calendrier pour le plugin School "
"Management. Gérez les horaires des cours, les événements et les horaires."

#. Author of the plugin
